# Sales Performance Dashboard – 2014

## Project Overview

The **Sales Performance Dashboard – 2014** is an interactive business intelligence dashboard designed to analyze sales performance across salespersons, products, sales ranges, months, and regions.

The dashboard provides a consolidated view of **$714,316 in total sales**, enabling users to identify high-performing sales representatives, analyze monthly sales trends, evaluate product contribution, and understand the distribution of sales across different sales ranges.

This project demonstrates the use of data visualization and dashboard design to transform sales data into actionable business insights.

## Dashboard Objectives

The primary objectives of this dashboard are to:

- Monitor overall sales performance.
- Compare sales performance across individual salespersons.
- Identify monthly sales trends and fluctuations.
- Determine the top-performing products.
- Analyze sales distribution by sales range.
- Provide region, salesperson, and date-based filtering.
- Support data-driven sales and business decisions.

